[Desktop Entry]
Name=SwayFX (0.20 / effects)
Comment=SwayFX 0.6 (sway 1.12 base) + wlroots 0.20.1 + scenefx 0.5 from /opt/swayfx — blur, rounded corners, shadows, animations
Exec=/opt/swayfx/bin/swayfx-session
Type=Application
DesktopNames=sway

# ⚠ THIS FILE IS NOT SYMLINKED BY dfinstall — it is the versioned source for
# /usr/share/wayland-sessions/swayfx.desktop, which the recipe in docs/sway.md
# installs. Same arrangement as config/sway/swayfx-session beside it.
#
# ⚠ DesktopNames MUST stay `sway`, not `swayfx`. GDM exports it as
# XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP, and xdg-desktop-portal resolves its per-desktop config by
# that value lowercased — so `swayfx` would silently orphan
# ~/.config/xdg-desktop-portal/sway-portals.conf and take screencast, the GTK
# file chooser and RemoteDesktop down with it, with no error anywhere.
#
# It sits alongside, and does not replace, the two existing entries:
#   sway.desktop       -> /usr/bin/sway            (trixie; broken when docked)
#   sway-next.desktop  -> /opt/sway-next/bin/sway  (1.11/0.19; the fallback)
